From c1924e6d8859d4d39b0d888f67bebd60d784879b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:47:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] security(android): retire compromised keystore, move release
 signing to Gradle + env/gitignored config

- untrack ednova-release.keystore and signed APK/AAB (signed with compromised key)
- remove hardcoded keystore password script; add Gradle signingConfig (v1/v2/v3) driven by keystore.properties or EDNOVA_* env
- gitignore keystores, keystore.properties, release artifacts
- document Play App Signing strategy (docs/ANDROID-SIGNING.md)
- debug builds unaffected; release is unsigned when no credentials present
---
